{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/80da562c2504ee50c4e56e871a8ad55e.poster.avif?t=1762587651\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/80da562c2504ee50c4e56e871a8ad55e.webm?t=1762587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/80da562c2504ee50c4e56e871a8ad55e.mp4?t=1762587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythmatch has all the joy of a merge game without any ads or microtransactions. Instead, we have a variety of gameplay and an anti-capitalist story about standing up against the gods of Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Family to Un-Find</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.poster.avif?t=1762587651\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.webm?t=1762587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.mp4?t=1762587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artemis was born to be a Goddess, but even amongst immortals, the gatekeeping runs deep. Use the spite to fuel you and show them what you're made of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help the Mortals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/6de4c4bb255ea745ca734ae00c9462bb.poster.avif?t=1762587651\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/6de4c4bb255ea745ca734ae00c9462bb.webm?t=1762587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/6de4c4bb255ea745ca734ae00c9462bb.mp4?t=1762587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Thrown down from Olympus, work with the mortals to\u00a0resources, craft materials, and build a new Ithaca that works for them. Gain Belief, power up, and take the fight back to Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge the Gods</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.poster.avif?t=1762587651\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.webm?t=1762587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.mp4?t=1762587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you\u2019re fixing up the mortal realm, you\u2019ll be tearing things down in Olympus. Prove your worth as you face the challenges from the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win, and you could earn their favour. Can you convince them to show grace to the mortals? Or are you all better off without them?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1778050?t=1762587651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati